vars:pre-request {
  @gateway: {{gatewayUrl}}
  @identity: {{identityUrl}}
}

docs {
  # SmartFarm Platform — Bruno Collection

  Ingress gateway: **{{gatewayUrl}}** (REST `/api/v1/*`, GraphQL `/graphql`).
  Identity service direct: **{{identityUrl}}** (needed ONLY for TOTP enrollment).

  Open this folder in Bruno (File → Open Collection), pick the **local** environment,
  then run folders top-down. Full walkthrough is in `README.md` beside this file.

  Auth model: everything except the public auth endpoints needs a Bearer token.
  Run `01 - identity/` first — it logs in and (for the SUPERADMIN admin account)
  walks TOTP enrollment, saving `accessToken` into the environment automatically.
}
